    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507590/extras/009165e798ae52b75272fa65b5fbbc0d.poster.avif?t=1737086528\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507590/extras/009165e798ae52b75272fa65b5fbbc0d.webm?t=1737086528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507590/extras/009165e798ae52b75272fa65b5fbbc0d.mp4?t=1737086528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>The Mouse Game</strong> is a hardcore puzzle game where you control a mouse and avoid deadly traps in order to secure the cheese. Run, dodge, and weave your way through 35 increasingly difficult levels!<br><br><strong>PERSONALIZE</strong> your mouse with dozens of unlockable colors and accessories!<br><br><strong>UNLOCK</strong> a diverse range of rewarding achievements!<br><br><strong>CHALLENGE</strong> your skills with 5 unique gameplay-altering challenge modes!<br><br><strong>IMPROVE</strong> your best attempts with faster completions!<br><br><strong>CONQUER</strong> the insurmountable <i>A.C.E.</i> achievement!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507590/extras/aba1f40a41fe5675e7f72f6c0d7153c8.poster.avif?t=1737086528\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507590/extras/aba1f40a41fe5675e7f72f6c0d7153c8.webm?t=1737086528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507590/extras/aba1f40a41fe5675e7f72f6c0d7153c8.mp4?t=1737086528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507590/extras/009165e798ae52b75272fa65b5fbbc0d.poster.avif?t=1737086528\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507590/extras/009165e798ae52b75272fa65b5fbbc0d.webm?t=1737086528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507590/extras/009165e798ae52b75272fa65b5fbbc0d.mp4?t=1737086528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>The Mouse Game</strong> is a hardcore puzzle game where you control a mouse and avoid deadly traps in order to secure the cheese. Run, dodge, and weave your way through 35 increasingly difficult levels!<br><br><strong>PERSONALIZE</strong> your mouse with dozens of unlockable colors and accessories!<br><br><strong>UNLOCK</strong> a diverse range of rewarding achievements!<br><br><strong>CHALLENGE</strong> your skills with 5 unique gameplay-altering challenge modes!<br><br><strong>IMPROVE</strong> your best attempts with faster completions!<br><br><strong>CONQUER</strong> the insurmountable <i>A.C.E.</i> achievement!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507590/extras/aba1f40a41fe5675e7f72f6c0d7153c8.poster.avif?t=1737086528\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507590/extras/aba1f40a41fe5675e7f72f6c0d7153c8.webm?t=1737086528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507590/extras/aba1f40a41fe5675e7f72f6c0d7153c8.mp4?t=1737086528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
